    "confidence": "high",
    "notes": "Eleven transactions from the attacker EOA call the exchange contract between blocks 19477009 and 19477249; netting ERC-20 transfers across all eleven gives exactly these three tokens, with the attacker helper contract 0x0da9fcc650e2109e09344fd571bb78091b781f06 receiving essentially all of it and a few wei reaching 0x02c57952e2e406a9a9af2dff2c280c59df9a8b8b. Losses fall on the individual approval-granting wallets, not on protocol-held funds. Contemporaneous reporting put the loss near USD 1.8 million. Nothing was recovered."
